# Fetch profile

```http
GET https://api.example.com/profile
    ?verbose=true
    &fields=name,email
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
```

```http expect
HTTP 200
```

```ts test
fw.test("jsonpath \"$.name\" startsWith \"De\"", () => fw.expect(String(fw.jsonpath(fw.response.json(), "$.name")[0]).startsWith("De")).toBeTruthy());
```

